This license covers the source of osu!taiko Video Resizer 2 only.

Release archives also bundle FFmpeg (ffmpeg.exe), which is licensed under the
GPL and is not covered by the above. Its licence text ships alongside it in
files/ffmpeg/LICENSE.txt. Bundled build: ffmpeg-20200821-412d63f-win64-static,
configured with --enable-gpl --enable-version3 --enable-libx264.
FFmpeg sources: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html

The frame layout and the original tool this one replaces are the work of
Khoo Hao Yit and Jerry:
https://osu.ppy.sh/community/forums/topics/1129583
